  "hooks": {
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "sh \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/format.sh\"", "timeout": 30 }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

The corrected version validates with no errors or warnings.

